# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The CI workflow regenerates the localisation files and
# then runs `git diff --exit-code` to prove they are up to date. Without this
# file, a Windows checkout converts the generated Dart to CRLF, the diff is never
# empty, and the check fails for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.xcuserstate binary
